    fuentes_gq_p: "Cosmobiology's most famous study: Michel Gauquelin found that <b>Mars appears more frequently rising or culminating</b> (houses 1 and 10) at the births of sports champions. Reproducible with our engine, since it already calculates Whole Sign houses with exact times.",
