    mc_3casillas_a: "<b>Topocentric houses</b> (Polich-Page): unequal cusps, depend on your real latitude. <b>Ecliptic plane + vernal point</b>: marks 0° Aries, the origin of longitudes. <b>Celestial equator</b>: its intersection with the ecliptic IS the vernal point.",
